================================================================================

JMCL.Telemetry (when added) originates from Colson's sandbox-safe
reimplementation of a subset of the Microsoft Application Insights .NET SDK
(github.com/Microsoft/ApplicationInsights-dotnet, MIT). The extent to which
it is reimplemented rather than copied is to be confirmed and this notice
updated accordingly.

The IoC container implementation is credited in its source comments to work
by Ken Egozi.
